#: scenario3:scenario3_60039B01_194E_401F_887A_8CA90615E312
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6b85ce1fac2d2494dc0e1a2a3c0ae48ca2b2f40096a9295b6d1c71cc7b3e434
