msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_60039B01_194E_401F_887A_8CA90615E312"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫God, watching him lose his cool was ⟪k:1⟫incredible⟪k:2⟫!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫My sides hurt just "
"thinking about it!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫真是一场好戏啊，⟪k:1⟫你那困惑的样子！⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫现在想起来也让人想捧腹大笑！！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F97C4C36_6410_47A6_8CF2_596B69E2AF16
